{"url": "https://www.utrgv.edu/gradcollege/our-programs/how-to-apply/index.htm", "final_url": "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/graduate/index.htm", "status": 200, "method": "chromium", "fetched": "2026-11-14", "text": "Skip to main content\nThe University of Texas Rio Grande Valley\nDIRECTORY\nMAPS\nMYUTRGV\nNews\nGIVE\nOPEN SEARCH MENU\nAdmissions\nFreshman\nTransfer\nInternational\nReturning\nGraduate\nNon-Degree\nFor Families\nApply Now\nVisit Campus\nExplore Programs\nRequest Info\nCheck Status\nContact Us\nGraduate Admissions\nWelcome Future Graduate Students!\nGraduate Admissions Menu\nFuture Students\nFuture Students options\nHow To Apply\nHow To Apply options\nApplication Resources\nApplication Resources options\nFunding\nFunding options\nSchedule an Appointment\nAdmitted\nAdmitted options\nGraduate Recruitment Staff Directory\nQuick Links\nGraduate Catalog\nRequest More Info\nYour Graduate Journey Begins Here\nOur mission is simple - to offer world-class academic programs and research opportunities that will enhance life in the Valley, the Americas, and the global community. As a graduate student here, you\u2019ll be on the forefront of the most innovative work being done in the sciences, health care, business, the arts and humanities, information science, mathematics, education, engineering, and all points in between.\nYour Brighter Future Is Just a Click Away\nExplore Graduate Programs\nRequest More Information\nApply Now\nIn The Spotlight\nUTRGV Grad Momentum Incentive\nUp to $1,000 Could Be Yours!\nRead more...\nabout UTRGV Grad Momentum Incentive\nGet Ahead by Getting Started\nSTEP\n1\nExplore Our Programs\nSearch for the Master's or Doctoral degree that interests you. Join an informational session, meet with a graduate recruiter or contact the Graduate Program Coordinator to learn more about the program, admission process and funding.\nSTEP\n2\nGRE & GMAT Entrance Exams\nWhile not required of all programs, if yours does, be sure to review this helpful information and take the exam as soon as possible.\nSTEP\n3\nApply\nComplete your online application and submit admission documents by the application deadline.\nSTEP\n4\nExplore how to Fund your Graduate Education\nTake advantage of financial aid, scholarships and other incentives offered to UTRGV graduate students.\nSTEP\n5\nCongratulations, You\u2019re In!\nOnce admitted into your graduate program you will take the following steps:\nSTEP\n6\nActivate your UTRGV Account\nYou'll need this in order to activate your UTRGV email and move forward with registration.\nSTEP\n7\nReview your Program of Study\nSearch for the program you were admitted to in the catalog and review the course requirements. These are the courses that make up your degree plan.\nSTEP\n8\nRegister for Classes\nYou will use your my.utrgv.edu account and click on the ASSIST application to register for classes.\nSTEP\n9\nAttend Orientation\nWhile orientation is not mandatory for graduate students it is strongly encouraged to learn more about graduate student policies, financial aid and much more!\nSTEP\n10\nPay for Classes\nPayment for classes are due prior to starting your classes. Log into my.utrgv.edu to review your bill and make necessary payment arrangements.\nMeet with a Graduate Recruiter\nOur UTRGV Graduate Recruiters have diverse backgrounds and are dedicated to advising prospective graduate students on our graduate program availability, admission requirements, and deadlines. They can give you an overview of available scholarships, and a financial aid options.\nSchedule Your Appointment Today\nKnowledge Hub\nCheck out our Blog!\nBrowse articles that help you take the next step.\nVisit UTRGV Grad Fair 2026 to RSVP and learn more!\nGraduate Info Sessions & Webinars\nNOVEMBER 19\nExplore UTRGV's Graduate Programs & Funding Opportunities Webinar\nDECEMBER 15\nExplore UTRGV's Graduate Programs & Funding Opportunities Webinar\nView All Events\nExplore Graduate Programs\nRequest More Info\nApply Now\nGraduate Admissions\nLocations\nBrownsville Campus:\nSabal Hall 1.202\nEdinburg Campus:\nMarialice Shary Shivers (MASS) Bldg. 1.158\nContact Information\nEmail: gradrecruitment@utrgv.edu\nPhone: 1-833-887-4842\nText: 956-996-8095\nWhatsApp: 956-996-8035\nFind us on Social Media\nLIKE. FOLLOW. SUBSCRIBE. ADD.\nFollow us on Facebook\nFollow us on X\nFollow us on Youtube\nFollow us on Instagram\nMy Texas Future is a state-supported resource that helps Texans explore careers, find college programs, and access financial aid options to start, return to, or advance their education.\nClery Act\nThe Annual Security and Fire Safety Report includes information on safety and security policies, including crime and fire statistics for the previous three years.\nThe report is available on the University Police website. A hard copy of the report is available at the University Police Departments located on 501 N. Sugar Rd. (Edinburg), 2671 FJRM Ave. (Brownsville), 2102 Treasure Hills Blvd. (Harlingen), or 1937 East Bustamante Street (Laredo), also by contacting University Police at 956-882-7777.\nCARES, CRRSAA and ARP Reporting\nSite Policies\nRequired Links\nAccreditation Statement\nFraud Reporting\nSenate Bill 18\nClery Act Reports\nWeb Accessibility\nMental Health Resources\nSexual Misconduct Policy\nReporting Sexual Misconduct\nContact UTRGV\n1-844-ATUTRGV\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nCost and Financial Aid\nStudent Life\nSearch Programs\nFirst-Year Students\nTransfer\nInternational Students\nGraduate Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty Resources\nStaff Resources\nUTRGV Careers\nVisit Campus\nDirectory\nThe University of Texas Rio Grande Valley\nWelcome to UTRGV! Explore programs, admissions, and financial aid. Start a conversation!", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/graduate/index.htm#maincontent"], ["UTRGV Admissions | #1 Ranked University in Texas | Explore Programs & Deadlines", "https://www.utrgv.edu/admissions/index.htm"], ["Freshman", "h